  "agreement": "Gene filter reproduced exactly (14,789). Atrogene log2FCs match S3.7.p1 within 0.06 (e.g. PLN LRT Trim63 2.56 vs 2.55, Fbxo32 2.74 vs 2.74). DEG counts are 50-70% of the paper's, with the same ordering in plantaris (LRT >> HRT) and soleus (HRT ~ LRT). Plain CPM gives an up-majority; the TMM audit restores the paper's down-majority (57-65% down), so the direction split is a normalisation effect. The DELTA interaction has 0-2 DEGs, consistent with the paper reporting no DELTA DEG count and using GSEA.",
